  "title": "Healing a House",
  "description": "Elynea Mothren needs three taproots soaked in the Headwaters of Harstrad to repair the withered part of Neloth's tower at Tel Mithryn.",
  "npc_facts": {
    "Elynea Mothren": {
      "base_facts": [
        "I am the apothecary at Tel Mithryn.",
        "Neloth is impossible to work for and blames me for everything.",
        "The tower withered overnight and Neloth demands I fix it immediately."
      ],
      "beat_facts": {
        "ACCEPT_QUEST": [
          "I have asked someone to fetch taproots and soak them in the Headwaters of Harstrad for me."
        ],
        "RETURN_WITH_SOAKED_TAPROOTS": [
          "The taproots have been soaked in the headwaters. I will keep two for myself and have the last one planted in the tower wall."
        ],
        "PLANT_TAPROOT": [
          "The taproot has been planted in the withered wall of the tower."
        ],
        "TALK_TO_ELYNEA_FINAL": [
          "The tower is healing. I paid the helper with some potions of well-being."
        ],
        "QUEST_COMPLETE": [
          "The withered tower has been healed. Neloth has already built a new room in it—a spriggan testing area with two caged spriggans.",
          "I paid the helper with two potions of well-being and let them take ingredients from my shop for free. I'll sell them more potions if they come back.",
          "I kept two soaked taproots for myself without telling Neloth. Maybe now he will finally stop pestering me about the tower.",
          "I have another task ready for anyone willing to help an old woman again."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
